<e/>vrf instance MGMT
<e/>username automation privilege 15 {/.*/}
<e/>aaa authorization exec default local
<e/>dns domain lab.internal
<e/>ip name-server vrf MGMT 10.100.0.1
<e/>ntp server vrf MGMT 10.100.0.1
<e/>logging vrf MGMT host 10.100.0.38
<e/>logging vrf MGMT source-interface Management1
<e/>snmp-server vrf MGMT
<e/>snmp-server view LAB iso included
<e/>snmp-server group LAB v3 priv read LAB
<e/>management api gnmi
   transport grpc default
      vrf MGMT
<e/>ip route vrf MGMT 0.0.0.0/0 10.100.0.1
<e/>management api http-commands
   no shutdown
   vrf MGMT
      no shutdown
service routing protocols model multi-agent
{d/}<e/>username admin {/.*/}
{d/}<e/>aaa root {/.*/}
